    "title": "Saugeen River Flow (SaugeenDay) Dataset",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.4656058",
    "publication_date": "2020-06-22",
    "description": "<p>This dataset contains a single very long time series representing the daily mean flow of the Saugeen River at Walkerton in cubic meters per second from 01/01/1915 to 31/12/1979.&nbsp;It was extracted from R deseasonalize package.&nbsp;The length of this time series is 23741.</p>",
